BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-74443\n\nFriday 17 July \nThe 13:16 Bomaderry to Kiama service runs 30 minutes earlier than the normal timetable\, leaving Bomaderry at 12:46.\nA replacement bus service leaves Bomaderry at 13:16\, stopping all stations to Kiama\, then express to Wollongong.\nThe 14:31 Bomaderry to Berry service runs 10 minutes later than the normal timetable\, leaving Bomaderry at 14:41.
DTEND:20260717T053000Z
DTSTART:20260717T020000Z
SUMMARY:Some trains run to a changed timetable. Buses replace some trains
